# DoodlePaws Backend API

## Architecture

- Browser never receives `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY`
- All DB access goes through Express BFF in `src/backend/src/index.ts`
- Map DB rows via `mappers.ts`; shared types in `types.ts`

## Security

- Require `SUPABASE_URL` and `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` via `env.ts`
- Production CORS: deny all unless `CORS_ORIGIN` is set
- Sanitize 500 responses — log details server-side only (`errors.ts`)
- Validate adoption POST: trim fields, max 200 chars, `petId` pattern `[a-z0-9-]+`
- Verify pet exists and `status === 'available'` before insert
- Rate limit adoption POST: 10 req/IP/min (in-memory)

## Error mapping

- `PGRST116` → 404 `{ error: "Not found" }`
- Missing schema → 503 with setup hint
- Other DB errors → 500 `{ error: "Internal server error" }`

## When changing endpoints

Update `docs/apiSpec.md` and `docs/techspec.md` in the same PR.
